@startuml use-case-soc
left to right direction
skinparam actorStyle awesome
actor "SOC Analyst" as SOC
rectangle "Detection and SOC workflow" {
  usecase "UC-06\nDashboard" as dashboard
  usecase "UC-07\nTìm kiếm attempt" as search
  usecase "UC-08\nXem evidence" as evidence
  usecase "UC-09\nACK / điều tra alert" as investigate
  usecase "UC-10\nPhân loại incident" as classify
  usecase "UC-11\nYêu cầu action" as action
  usecase "UC-12\nĐóng incident" as close
}
SOC --> dashboard
SOC --> search
SOC --> evidence
SOC --> investigate
SOC --> classify
SOC --> action
SOC --> close
investigate ..> evidence : <<include>>
classify ..> investigate : <<extend>>
action ..> investigate : <<extend>>
close ..> investigate : <<extend>>
note right of action
The analyst requests an action.
core-app validates and enforces it.
end note
@enduml
